tic propagation from node1 to node2 well inside the 15-minute limit, and final state was synchronized and healthy. The restart evidence protocol was also complete for both nodes: each had a healthy pre-restart baseline, restart acknowledgement, changed boot identity, recovered configuration and services, and successful post-restart synchronization. Fixed lifecycle boot identities independently corroborate both restarts.","limitations":["The original authoritative file was absent, so the executor created a minimal source configuration before testing; there was no pre-existing application configuration whose contents could be preserved.","The evidence validates one representative source-file change rather than every possible file content or concurrent-write scenario."]}
